{
 "id": "seg3",
 "title": "推高现货价",
 "pill": 3,
 "total": 147.83,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg3-00",
   "text": "最常见的错误，是用 AMM 的现货价定价。",
   "spoken": "最常见的错误，是用 AMM 的现货价定价。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg3-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 4.056,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 4.805
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "恒定乘积池里，两种资产的数量相乘，保持不变。",
   "spoken": "恒定乘积池里，两种资产的数量相乘，保持不变。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg3-01.mp3",
   "start": 5.876,
   "dur": 5.088,
   "speechStart": 5.974,
   "speechEnd": 10.128
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "现货价，就是两边储备的比值。",
   "spoken": "现货价，就是两边储备的比值。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg3-02.mp3",
   "start": 11.184,
   "dur": 3.456,
   "speechStart": 11.282,
   "speechEnd": 13.794
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "再猜一道题。这是示例，忽略手续费。",
   "spoken": "再猜一道题。这是示例，忽略手续费。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg3-03.mp3",
   "start": 14.86,
   "dur": 4.464,
   "speechStart": 14.958,
   "speechEnd": 18.491
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "池子里有 1000 个 ETH，和 200 万 USDC。现货价是 2000。",
   "spoken": "池子里有 1000 个 ETH，和 200 万 USDC。现货价是 2000。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg3-04.mp3",
   "start": 19.544,
   "dur": 6.072,
   "speechStart": 19.642,
   "speechEnd": 24.782
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "有人用 400 万 USDC，买入 ETH。",
   "spoken": "有人用 400 万 USDC，买入 ETH。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg3-05.mp3",
   "start": 25.836,
   "dur": 4.224,
   "speechStart": 25.934,
   "speechEnd": 29.231
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "现货价会变成多少？",
   "spoken": "现货价会变成多少？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg3-06.mp3",
   "start": 30.28,
   "dur": 2.52,
   "speechStart": 30.378,
   "speechEnd": 31.949
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "大约 18000。USDC 储备变成 600 万，ETH 只剩约 333 个。",
   "spoken": "大约 18000。USDC 储备变成 600 万，ETH 只剩约 333 个。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg3-07.mp3",
   "start": 33.3,
   "dur": 7.056,
   "speechStart": 33.398,
   "speechEnd": 39.514
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-08",
   "text": "价格涨到原来的 9 倍。只用了一笔交换。",
   "spoken": "价格涨到原来的 9 倍。只用了一笔交换。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg3-08.mp3",
   "start": 40.576,
   "dur": 4.032,
   "speechStart": 40.674,
   "speechEnd": 43.755
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-09",
   "text": "现在看一个借贷合约。",
   "spoken": "现在看一个借贷合约。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg3-09.mp3",
   "start": 44.828,
   "dur": 2.304,
   "speechStart": 44.926,
   "speechEnd": 46.295
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-10",
   "text": "它读取池子的储备，用两边的比值当价格。",
   "spoken": "它读取池子的储备，用两边的比值当价格。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg3-10.mp3",
   "start": 47.352,
   "dur": 4.248,
   "speechStart": 47.45,
   "speechEnd": 50.747
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-11",
   "text": "抵押品价值，等于数量乘这个价格。最多借出价值的百分之 75。这也是示例。",
   "spoken": "抵押品价值，等于数量乘这个价格。最多借出价值的百分之 75。这也是示例。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg3-11.mp3",
   "start": 51.82,
   "dur": 7.8,
   "speechStart": 51.918,
   "speechEnd": 58.772
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-12",
   "text": "把这几步串起来，是一笔交易里的五个动作。",
   "spoken": "把这几步串起来，是一笔交易里的五个动作。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg3-12.mp3",
   "start": 59.84,
   "dur": 3.792,
   "speechStart": 59.938,
   "speechEnd": 62.795
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-13",
   "text": "第一，借出闪电贷，在池子里买入代币，把现货价推高。",
   "spoken": "第一，借出闪电贷，在池子里买入代币，把现货价推高。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg3-13.mp3",
   "start": 63.852,
   "dur": 5.472,
   "speechStart": 63.95,
   "speechEnd": 68.485
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-14",
   "text": "第二，存入少量代币，作为抵押。",
   "spoken": "第二，存入少量代币，作为抵押。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg3-14.mp3",
   "start": 69.544,
   "dur": 3.816,
   "speechStart": 69.642,
   "speechEnd": 72.523
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-15",
   "text": "第三，协议读取储备，按虚高的价格，借出大笔资金。",
   "spoken": "第三，协议读取储备，按虚高的价格，借出大笔资金。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg3-15.mp3",
   "start": 73.58,
   "dur": 5.784,
   "speechStart": 73.678,
   "speechEnd": 78.511
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-16",
   "text": "第四，卖回代币。",
   "spoken": "第四，卖回代币。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg3-16.mp3",
   "start": 79.584,
   "dur": 2.544,
   "speechStart": 79.682,
   "speechEnd": 81.277
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-17",
   "text": "第五，归还闪电贷和手续费。",
   "spoken": "第五，归环闪电贷和手续费。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg3-17.mp3",
   "start": 82.348,
   "dur": 3.36,
   "speechStart": 82.446,
   "speechEnd": 84.874
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-18",
   "text": "交易结束，抵押品的真实价值，远低于借款。协议留下坏账。",
   "spoken": "交易结束，抵押品的真实价值，远低于借款。协议留下坏账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg3-18.mp3",
   "start": 85.928,
   "dur": 6.48,
   "speechStart": 86.026,
   "speechEnd": 91.559
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-19",
   "text": "利润，是借出的金额，减去两次交换的滑点、手续费，和闪电贷费用。",
   "spoken": "利润，是借出的金额，减去两次交换的滑点、手续费，和闪电贷费用。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg3-19.mp3",
   "start": 92.628,
   "dur": 6.72,
   "speechStart": 92.726,
   "speechEnd": 98.499
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-20",
   "text": "池子越浅，推高价格越便宜。长尾资产和低流动性代币，风险最高。",
   "spoken": "池子越浅，推高价格越便宜。常尾资产和低流动性代币，风险最高。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg3-20.mp3",
   "start": 99.568,
   "dur": 7.32,
   "speechStart": 99.666,
   "speechEnd": 106.044
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-21",
   "text": "这类事件，在公开报道里反复出现。",
   "spoken": "这类事件，在公开报道里反复出现。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg3-21.mp3",
   "start": 107.108,
   "dur": 3.648,
   "speechStart": 107.206,
   "speechEnd": 109.92
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-22",
   "text": "2020 年 2 月的 bZx，是最早被广泛报道的闪电贷价格操纵之一，两次合计约 95 万美元。",
   "spoken": "2020 年 2 月的 bZx，是最早被广泛报道的闪电贷价格操纵之一，两次合计约 95 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg3-22.mp3",
   "start": 110.976,
   "dur": 8.352,
   "speechStart": 111.074,
   "speechEnd": 118.478
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-23",
   "text": "2021 年 5 月，BNB Chain 上的 PancakeBunny，按池子储备计算 LP 代币价值，损失约 4500 万美元。",
   "spoken": "2021 年 5 月，BNB Chain 上的 PancakeBunny，按池子储备计算 LP 代币价值，损失约 4500 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg3-23.mp3",
   "start": 119.548,
   "dur": 8.976,
   "speechStart": 119.646,
   "speechEnd": 127.693
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-24",
   "text": "2021 年 10 月，Cream Finance 用金库份额价格，给抵押品估值。",
   "spoken": "2021 年 10 月，Cream Finance 用金库份额价格，给抵押品估值。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg3-24.mp3",
   "start": 128.744,
   "dur": 5.88,
   "speechStart": 128.842,
   "speechEnd": 133.794
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-25",
   "text": "攻击者向金库捐赠，抬高份额价格。损失约 1.3 亿美元。",
   "spoken": "攻击者向金库捐赠，抬高份额价格。损失约 1.3 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg3-25.mp3",
   "start": 134.844,
   "dur": 6.168,
   "speechStart": 134.942,
   "speechEnd": 140.177
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-26",
   "text": "三起事件，根因一样：价格来自一笔交易就能改写的数据。",
   "spoken": "三起事件，根因一样：价格来自一笔交易就能改写的数据。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg3-26.mp3",
   "start": 141.232,
   "dur": 5.4,
   "speechStart": 141.33,
   "speechEnd": 145.794
  }
